  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    if not grid or not grid[0]:\n        return grid\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Create output as a deep copy of input\n    output = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Scan for all 3x3 blocks of zeros\n    for i in range(rows - 2):\n        for j in range(cols - 2):\n            # Check if 3x3 block starting at (i, j) is all zeros\n            is_zero_block = True\n            for di in range(3):\n                for dj in range(3):\n                    if grid[i + di][j + dj] != 0:\n                        is_zero_block = False\n                        break\n                if not is_zero_block:\n                    break\n            \n            # If found, fill with 1s\n            if is_zero_block:\n                for di in range(3):\n                    for dj in range(3):\n                        output[i + di][j + dj] = 1\n    \n    return output",
